---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Mario Leone — AI Consulting, MCP and Software | Leone Consulting" description="Mario Leone: MCP architectures, custom AI agents, open-source LLM fine-tuning and inference, software development and data pipelines.">
  <Header />

  <main>
    <section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-50 to-white" aria-labelledby="profile-title">
      <div class="container mx-auto">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 text-center md:text-left">
          <img src="/images/mario-leone-portrait.webp" alt="Professional portrait of Mario Leone" width="512" height="512" class="w-40 h-40 md:w-48 md:h-48 rounded-full object-cover ring-4 ring-white shadow-lg shrink-0" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
          <div>
            <h1 id="profile-title" class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Mario Leone</h1>
            <p class="text-2xl font-semibold text-primary-600 mb-8">AI consulting, MCP architectures and software development</p>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">I’m Mario Leone. Through Leone Consulting, I help businesses and professionals design and build AI solutions integrated with their tools, data and workflows.</p>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">I personally handle each project, from initial analysis to deployment. You work directly with me to define requirements, discuss technical choices and verify results.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-50" aria-labelledby="method-title">
      <div class="container mx-auto">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center mb-12">
          <h2 id="method-title" class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">How I work</h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">I start with the problem to solve and the systems already in place. I choose between custom development and adapting existing platforms based on objectives, constraints and budget.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <li class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-600" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-3 mb-4">Analysis and objectives</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">I clarify requirements, available data and operational constraints. I define what to build and how to verify that it works.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-600" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-3 mb-4">Design and development</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">I assess alternatives, document technical decisions and develop in verifiable steps, keeping you involved throughout the work.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-600" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-3 mb-4">Validation and deployment</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">I check how the solution behaves, document its use and prepare its integration into business processes.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 px-6" aria-labelledby="expertise-title">
      <div class="container mx-auto">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center mb-12">
          <h2 id="expertise-title" class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Expertise</h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">From tool integration to model adaptation, I design the components needed for each use case.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
          <div class="bg-primary-50 p-8 rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">MCP architectures</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">I design integrations based on the Model Context Protocol (MCP) to connect AI assistants and agents with business tools, data sources and applications, with permissions and traceable operations.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary-50 p-8 rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Intelligent agents</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">I build custom agents or adapt existing platforms and stacks to business requirements. I define tools, tasks and human review points around the workflow they support.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary-50 p-8 rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Open-source LLMs</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">I select and adapt open-source LLMs, including fine-tuning on domain data and configuring and optimizing inference. I prepare models for deployment in local or cloud environments according to project requirements.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary-50 p-8 rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Custom dashboards</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">I design dashboards that bring a client’s tools and relevant information together in one control point, so they can monitor and manage them from a single interface.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary-50 p-8 rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Cybersecurity</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">I consider security from the start of system design, including risk analysis, access control, data protection and integration reviews.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary-50 p-8 rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Software and data pipelines</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">I develop applications, APIs and pipelines to collect, transform and use data. I focus on data quality, integration with existing systems and maintainable code.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-50" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
      <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
        <h2 id="projects-title" class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Projects and background</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">Explore examples of my work in the portfolio, or read my CV for my experience and technical skills.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/en/portfolio" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-primary-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-700 transition-colors font-semibold focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-primary-600">Explore the portfolio</a>
          <a href="/en/cv" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 border-2 border-primary-600 text-primary-600 rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-50 transition-colors font-semibold focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-primary-600">View my CV</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-primary-600 text-white" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <div class="container mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 id="contact-title" class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Let’s discuss your project</h2>
        <p class="text-xl mb-8 text-primary-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Tell me about the problem you want to solve, the tools you use and the constraints involved. We can assess a practical first step together.</p>
        <a href="/en/contact" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-white text-primary-600 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors font-semibold shadow-lg focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white">Contact me</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
